{"quest_id": 8157, "name": "魔女スィーテンを探して", "description": "スィーテンを探して沼地にやってきた\n王子一行に助けを求める女性の声が届く。\n＜毒：HPに継続ダメージ＞\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "modifier_notes": ["毒：HPに継続ダメージ"], "event": "ビタースイートアイヴィワルツ", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920210, "map_no": 4843, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 50, "exp": 270, "gold": 1200, "drops": [{"card": 44, "c": 1}, {"card": 19, "c": 1}, {"card": 57, "c": 1}, {"item": 1007, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 8, "params": [0, 5, 30]}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 6000, "attack": 1200, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 1200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 66, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2129392, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 4, "master_id": 33834, "global_id": 7451, "to_condition": 4, "to_ticks": 1, "to_global_id": 7452}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 6000, "attack": 1200, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 1200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 66, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2129392, "special_effect_id": 548, "master_id": 33835, "global_id": 7452, "from_condition": 4, "trigger_ticks": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 23, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 1300, "attack": 280, "base_hp": 1300, "base_attack": 280, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 95, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098944, "special_effect_id": 39, "missile_id": 65, "missile": {"speed": 9.0}, "master_id": 131, "global_id": 130, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 4000, "attack": 240, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 240, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 98, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2115520, "special_effect_id": 308, "master_id": 31219, "global_id": 4838, "spawn_sec": 87}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 900, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 900, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 280, "attack_speed": 100, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 211, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.7999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098960, "special_effect_id": 94, "master_id": 662, "global_id": 661, "spawn_sec": 119}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 12000, "attack": 850, "base_hp": 12000, "base_attack": 850, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 139, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2119376, "special_effect_id": 400, "master_id": 31845, "global_id": 5464, "spawn_sec": 167}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "uncounted": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 186, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149792, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 7, "master_id": 37021, "global_id": 10638, "route_behaviour": {"hold": {"routes": 1, "held": 1}}, "spawn_sec": 179}], "popups": ["マンドラゴラは\nブロックすると一度だけ\n強力な攻撃を行い、自滅します。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "キャロップ", "text": "なんか変なにおいがする……。\nああえっと、シャディアさんのチョコの事じゃなくてね？", "face": "u2059a1"}, {"name": "シャディア", "text": "知っているが？", "face": "u2056a1"}, {"name": "ワルツ", "text": "きっと、この辺りの毒沼のせいね。\n魔法のクッキーも、なんだか調子が悪そうにしてるの。", "face": "u2058a1"}, {"name": "キャロップ", "text": "スィーテンの居場所を示してくれてるんだっけ？\n結構歩いたから、そろそろ着いてもいいんだけど……。", "face": "u2059a1"}, {"name": "女性", "text": "――助けてください！\n魔物に襲われています！", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}, {"name": "キャロップ", "text": "むっ……助けを求める声がする。\n魔女探しはちょっとだけお休みだね。", "face": "u2059a1"}, {"name": "シャディア", "text": "ああ、あの女性を助けよう。\nただ、気を付けるべきは――。", "face": "u2056a1"}, {"name": "女性", "text": "この毒の沼地は、人間には危険です。\n体力が削がれては勿体ないです。\n回復しながら、戦ってください。どうか。", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}, {"name": "ワルツ", "text": "えっ……？　ああごめんなさい、大切なことよね。\n皆、毒沼には気をつけて戦いましょう！", "face": "u2058a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ワルツ", "text": "うん、全部片付いたみたい。\nお姉さん、怪我はありませんか？", "face": "u2058a1"}, {"name": "女性", "text": "はい、怪我はありません。\nただ私の街は今、魔女の手の内にあるんです。", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}, {"name": "キャロップ", "text": "魔女……？\nスィーテンについて、なにか知っているの？", "face": "u2059a1"}, {"name": "女性", "text": "ええ、人びとはすべて、かしに。\n街はあちらの、明るい色の道を駆けた先です。", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}, {"name": "女性", "text": "案内します――っと、すみません、立つのが大変で。", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}, {"name": "ワルツ", "text": "あら、腰が抜けてしまったのかしら？", "face": "u2058a1"}, {"name": "ワルツ", "text": "皆、先にスィーテンの居る街に行って？\n私は、この方を介抱しながら追いかけるから。", "face": "u2058a1"}, {"name": "シャディア", "text": "（素性の知れない女ではあるが、悪意は感じ取れない。\nだがこいつは恐らく……なら、今すべきは……）", "face": "u2056a1"}, {"name": "シャディア", "text": "ああ、分かった。\n急ごう皆、振り返らず走るぞ。", "face": "u2056a1"}, {"name": "キャロップ", "text": "う、うん。", "face": "u2059a1"}, {"name": "女性", "text": "うつくしいですね。\n貴方と、仲間たち。その信頼と勇気は。", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}, {"name": "ワルツ", "text": "ええ。誇らしい人たちです。\n……ところで、もう歩けるのですか？\nそれに、そっちは皆が向かった道では――。", "face": "u2058a1"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "ほんとうの街は、こちらに。この暗き道の先に。\nうつくしさの損なわれない、完璧なる花園へどうぞ。", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "愛より出でて愛より赤く。\n私は何より人間がだいすき。\n老いて枯れゆき死に臨む前に、えいえんの、かしに。", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}, {"name": "スィーテン", "text": "――あなたを、仮死にしてあげる。", "face": "l22719d3937ab"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920210_4843", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 674, "y": 46}, {"k": "m", "x": 159, "y": 246, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 258, "y": 342, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 396, "y": 376, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 545, "y": 400, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 688, "y": 410, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 666, "y": 301, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 563, "y": 238, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 490, "y": 160, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 365, "y": 179, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 239, "y": 193, "id": 209}, {"k": "r", "x": 126, "y": 301, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 130, "y": 196, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 301, "y": 132, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 465, "y": 99, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 586, "y": 184, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 733, "y": 327, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 570, "y": 295, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 613, "y": 359, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 488, "y": 336, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 321, "y": 309, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 285, "y": 244, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 244, "y": 407, "id": 311}, {"k": "r", "x": 365, "y": 427, "id": 312}, {"k": "r", "x": 582, "y": 453, "id": 313}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true}